            "zh": "比利时的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " Hergé painted the picture for his 1936 book, "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "The Blue Lotus"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "",
            "zh": "《蓝莲》"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". In this book, Tintin and his dog Snowy travel to China."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "In that picture, Tintin and Snowy are "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "vase",
            "ref": "v-vase"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". A huge red "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "dragon",
            "ref": "v-dragon"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " is flying above them. Hergé wanted to use the painting for the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "cover",
            "zh": "封面"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of the book. But then he was told it would cost too much to "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "So he painted a "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " one. It has a black dragon and a red background. This picture became the cover. Hergé then gave the first "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to the 7-year-old son of his "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "editor",
            "zh": "编辑"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". It stayed in a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "drawer",
            "zh": "抽屉"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " until 1981."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Read the book "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "The Blue Lotus"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". What would you paint for its cover?"
          }
        ]
